# The entire per-database drizzle/ tree is base-generated/managed (config,
# schema.generated.ts, migrations, release.ts, introspect output). Don't reformat
# any of it — notably schema.generated.ts, which `schema:check` compares
# byte-for-byte against the raw generator output (Prettier rewrapping it = false drift).
**/database/**/drizzle/**

# Generated GraphQL output (`base graphql generate`) — SDL + optional --metadata
# JSON. Generator-owned and byte-compared by the gql schema check; don't reformat.
**/graphql/schemas/**

# Generated API-reference artifacts (`npm run reference:generate`). Gitignored,
# but Prettier still walks them on disk — without this, `npm run ci` fails for
# anyone who has run the generator locally.
scripts/reference-gen/artifacts/**
